# Cursor Prompt — Implement Novend SaaS Pricing, Billing, Activation & Restrictions

This task introduces the **commercial licensing architecture** for Novend POS. The system must support subscription billing, lifetime licensing, organization activation, feature restrictions, cloud backup limits, and device management.

**Important:** The current implementation should treat **Lifetime** as the default active plan until online billing is introduced. Build the complete architecture now so Paystack can be connected later without changing the database design.

---

# 1. SaaS Billing Architecture

The subscription belongs to the **Organization**, never to individual users.

Hierarchy:

* Platform (Super Admin)
* Organization
* Subscription
* Branches
* Users
* Devices

Every organization has exactly one active plan.

