# 6. User Restrictions

Enforce maximum staff accounts by plan.

| Plan       | Max Users |
| ---------- | --------: |
| Basic      |         3 |
| Pro        |        15 |
| Enterprise | Unlimited |
| Lifetime   | Unlimited |

When limit is reached:

* Prevent creating another user.
* Show upgrade dialog.
* Existing users continue working.

