# 9. Cloud Backup Limits

Cloud backup is included in every plan but reduced.

| Plan       | Cloud Backup |
| ---------- | -----------: |
| Basic      |         2 GB |
| Pro        |        10 GB |
| Enterprise |        50 GB |
| Lifetime   |        10 GB |

Display:

* Used space
* Remaining space
* Backup history
* Manual backup
* Last backup date

When storage exceeds limit:

* Local backups continue.
* Cloud backups pause.
* Show upgrade/storage warning.

Never disable the POS because of storage.

